      "source": "https://www.townofjonesport.com/living-visiting/history.php"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Sawyer Square features the historic Sawyer Building, constructed by Daniel James Sawyer and his brother Edward, who together owned 43 wooden vessels during their 16‑year business.",
